              promotion: "full",
              is_shoppable: false,
              facebook_posts: [],
              description:
                'Is there anything more captivating than beautiful, mesmerizing fruit cakes? We could stare at them for hours. (And in fact, we have!) The <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/peaches-n-cream-cheesecake">peaches \'n\' cream cake</a> is a total crowd favorite and our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/easy-upside-down-kiwi-cake">upside-down kiwi cake</a> is enough to make anyone drool! Share them with your friends and family — or keep them all yourself. They’re so good that we wouldn’t blame you!',
              video_url: "https://vid.tasty.co/output/216408/hls24_1631883743.m3u8",
