              country: "US",
              is_shoppable: false,
              description:
                'Your job might be a joke, you might be broke, and your love life might be DOA, but your palate is definitely going to be satisfied with these recipes! Tasty has organized a very F.R.I.E.N.D-ly birthday celebration for Ross. Obviously, we are going to serve the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/leftover-turkey-sandwich">Leftover Turkey Sandwich</a> (you might have to add your own moist maker), followed by <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/cherry-pie-filled-cheesecake">Cherry Pie-Filled Cheesecake</a>, which made Rachel and Chandler fight to the death. Fret not, we have something for you AND all your friends.',
