              draft_status: "published",
              video_id: 172580,
              keywords: null,
              description:
                'Bananas are the perfect fruit to transform into an exciting dessert. They are full of fiber, potassium, and other nutrients. Bananas can be eaten raw or cooked in many ways. They can be baked as muffins or breads, blended into smoothies, used to make ice cream, or even turned into banana chips! We have put together the best dessert recipes you can make with bananas.\nFrom <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/peanut-butter-banana-brownies"> Peanut Butter Banana Brownies </a> to <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/banana-ice-cream-chocolate-bites"> Banana Ice Cream Chocolate Bites </a>, these recipes will leave you wanting more and more. No wonder the minions loved bananas!',
