              promotion: "full",
              aspect_ratio: "1:1",
              description:
                "Fact: No one can resist a perfect brownie. But brownies are a tricky art: you need the perfect 'goo' factor, a wonderful dose of fudge, and a light, crisp crust. Whether you prefer our gooey <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/the-best-fudgy-brownies\">fudge brownies</a> or our scrumptious <a href=\"https://tasty.co/recipe/loaded-brownies\">loaded brownies</a>, we think it's time for you to make them ALL. Every brownie is unique in its own way. Don't believe us? Try them yourself! ",
